// Registry Persistence Mechanisms in Recycle Bin | T1547 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_event/registry_event_persistence_recycle_bin.yml
(winlog.event_data.EventType:RenameKey AND winlog.event_data.NewName:*\\CLSID\\\{645FF040\-5081\-101B\-9F08\-00AA002F954E\}\\shell\\open*) OR (winlog.event_data.EventType:SetValue AND registry.path:*\\CLSID\\\{645FF040\-5081\-101B\-9F08\-00AA002F954E\}\\shell\\open\\command\\\(Default\)*)
